Description:
Know-how, inspiration, tools
– and the brick that does the trick.

Electronics, software and technology in one solution;
CPU modules for embedded systems;
WinCE, Embedded Linux and other operating systems

We assist your development project every step of the way.

RoboBend takes over the operations of your metal bending machines that would else have been done manually. This makes you:
• More efficient – Robobend is able to bend more pieces than the operator and you can therefore increase your bending capacity on your existing press brakes;
• RoboBend replaces the manual operator – and removes the problem of finding qualified machine operators;
• Able to bend – also when no technical expert is around. It is easy to set up, program and prepare for bending;
• Able to bend at the same high quality – every time – as our smart barrier system detects that you place the metal piece correctly in the press brake;
• Able to switch between manual and automatic bending or even between several bending machines – as RoboBend is mobile and can work with all the different bending machines (universal interface between the robot and the bending machines).

Let's make your business case ready - contact us!
